{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"成立。H3已建立“亲近带来真实欢喜、享受靠近本身”，S04-B4又直接给出“还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得了”“想多留在这一刻”，足以支持“舍不得这一刻过去”；B1的更迫切、反复补说，B3的不自觉握紧，以及B4持续向前、近似倒数的水波，都能具体支持“温柔里生出急切”。这条解释不是只宣布听感，而是给出了因果：正因为亲近的欢喜已经真实可感，当前这一刻变得值得留住，于是舍不得它流逝，进而产生急切。没有依赖未建立的人物前史或具体外部事件。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S04-B1：尚未具体解释这一遍为何显得更华丽、花腔为何有近乎耀眼的强光感，以及反复折回补充细节这一表现层面。\",\"S04-B2：尚未解释情绪冲到炽热高处后又同时退弱、不能稳稳落下，以及颤抖/哽咽和第34小节逐渐安静的变化。\",\"S04-B3：尚未解释“自己尚未意识到害怕，动作已经先透露出来”的潜在不安，以及越用力抓紧、平衡反而越脆弱的矛盾感。\",\"S04-B4：虽已覆盖“舍不得当下”和由此生出的急切，但尚未充分解释甜蜜为何同时带来鼻酸这一酸甜并存的质感。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a0b91e71-f04c-4566-9bf2-35c7ec73a39a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045548836726Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:00.027584+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "389a2f28fe3e91fa9e125006e02fde59a2d7425aa3c3e798efdcef544fbc9c9c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144